	"_comment": [
		"tints.kit  — THE JERSEY. The one saturated colour a house paints its KIT in:",
		"  tabard, cloak, hood, shield face, caparison, helm and crest. It is allowed to",
		"  be loud because it is no longer everywhere — steel, leather, skin, bone, wood",
		"  and the horse's coat are NATURAL and never take it (PieceAssets.MATERIAL_ROLES).",
		"tints.piece / tints.tower — the WHISPER. The old army-wide multiply, kept only",
		"  as the faint cast natural surfaces take so an army still hangs together.",
		"coat — the horse's natural coat (PieceAssets.COAT_PALETTES). Never a house hue:",
		"  a mount's house identity lives in its caparison, not in the animal."
